{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16455","headline":"胡笳十八拍 第十六拍 · 刘商","name":"胡笳十八拍 第十六拍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去时只觉天苍苍，归日始知胡地长。\n重阴白日落何处，秋雁所向应南方。\n平沙四顾自迷惑，远近悠悠随雁行。\n征途未尽马蹄尽，不见行人边草黄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘商","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16455.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16455","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}